# Cloudflare reads this file and doesn't serve it. Every file in public/ goes
# out with these; what worker.js answers itself (the API, pictures, the feed,
# the 404) sets its own.
#
#   nosniff             a file is only ever what its type says
#   Referrer-Policy     links off the site say where from, not which page
#   frame-ancestors     no other site can show these pages in a frame of its
#   X-Frame-Options     own (the desktop shows its own windows, which is fine)
#   Permissions-Policy  nothing here needs the camera, the microphone or where
#                       you are, so nothing on it gets them
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
